041C76             3519*    ; Return the unsigned shortest distance between two library angles. Angles
041C76             3520*    ; are periodic modulo 32768 raw units in the generated 256-phase model.
041C76             3521*    ;
041C76             3522*    ; inputs:  HL=left angle, DE=right angle
