041C89             3537*    ; Compare the upright and inverted exact-phase representations against the
041C89             3538*    ; previously emitted Euler pair. The unsigned sum of two 0..16384 component
041C89             3539*    ; distances is at most 32768. An exact tie retains the prior branch.
041C89             3540*    ;
041C89             3541*    ; inputs:
041C89             3542*    ;   ix -> camera state
041C89             3543*    ;   iy -> look-at work frame with canonical pitch at +0, yaw at +12,
041C89             3544*    ;         candidate flags at +9
041C89             3545*    ; outputs:
041C89             3546*    ;   canonical pitch/yaw restored in the work frame
041C89             3547*    ;   candidate inverted flag selected/cleared for the caller to materialize
041C89             3548*    ; destroys:
